erarchy 2\u003e\u00261 | tools/dtime | sort -n | grep git.*config | nl\n     1\t    4 2017-03-23 17:36:10,581 [DEBUG] Running: ['git', 'config', '-z', '-l', '--show-origin']\n     2\t    5 2017-03-23 17:36:10,711 [DEBUG] Running: ['git', 'config', '--file', '/tmp/datalad_temp_test_make_studyforrest_mockupXpmyrN/public/.datalad/config', '--add', 'datalad.dataset.id', 'd288053e-0fe6-11e7-ae31-f0d5bf7b5561']\n     3\t    5 2017-03-23 17:36:11,110 [DEBUG] Running: ['git', 'config', '-z', '-l', '--show-origin']\n....\n   152\t   50 2017-03-23 17:36:10,661 [DEBUG] Running: ['git', 'config', '--local', 'annex.backends', 'MD5E']\n   153\t   60 2017-03-23 17:36:31,279 [DEBUG] Running: ['git', 'config', '--local', 'annex.backends', 'MD5E']\n   154\t   61 2017-03-23 17:37:00,986 [DEBUG] Running: ['git', 'config', '--local', 'annex.backends', 'MD5E']\nDATALAD_LOG_TIMESTAMP=1 DATALAD_LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG python -m nose -s -v  2\u003e\u00261  43,38s user 8,00s system 72% cpu 1:11,21 total\ntools/dtime  0,08s user 0,02s system 0% cpu 1:11,21 total\n````\n\nwhich is down from\n\n````\n% DATALAD_LOG_TIMESTAMP=1 DATALAD_LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG python -m nose -s -v datalad/interface/tests/test_utils.py:test_save_hierarchy 2\u003e\u00261 | tools/dtime | sort -n | grep git.*config | nl\n     1\t    4 2017-03-23 17:39:18,752 [DEBUG] Running: ['git', 'config', '-z', '-l']\n     2\t    4 2017-03-23 17:39:18,756 [DEBUG] Running: ['git', 'config', '--local', 'annex.backends', 'MD5E']\n     3\t    4 2017-03-23 17:39:19,529 [DEBUG] Running: ['git', 'config', '-z', '-l', '--file', '/tmp/datalad_temp_test_make_studyforrest_mockupfRYik1/public/phase1/.datalad/config']\n....\n   850\t  143 2017-03-23 17:40:28,236 [DEBUG] Running: ['git', 'config', '-z', '-l']\n   851\t  151 2017-03-23 17:40:35,792 [DEBUG] Running: ['git', 'config', '-z', '-l']\n   852\t  263 2017-03-23 17:40:30,272 [DEBUG] Running: ['git', 'config', '-z', '-l']\nDATALAD_LOG_TIMESTAMP=1 DATALAD_LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG python -m nose -s -v  2\u003e\u00261  44,50s user 10,11s system 70% cpu 1:17,88 total\ntools/dtime  0,12s user 0,03s system 0% cpu 1:17,88 total\n````\n\nNot much impact on runtime, but call frequency is substantially reduced. Implemented via mtime tracking -- in a conservative way -- reload whenever mtime is different (any direction), so should not cause much hassle.","files":null},{"type":5,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1490342403,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDE0OlVubGFiZWxlZEV2ZW50MTAxMzgyNDMxMA=="},"added":[],"removed":["WIP"]}]}